                "text": "Climate change is real and urgent. We ignore it at our own peril. These rollbacks on climate and health protections like safe drinking water and clean air, will hurt millions of Americans while padding polluters\u2019 profits. The EPA\u2019s job is to protect us\u2014gutting protections is a betrayal. More disasters, more disease\u2014that\u2019s the cost. Outraged doesn\u2019t even begin to cover it.",
