                "text": "Last week I visited the Bronx VA Medical Center to speak with staff and veterans about the high quality of services and research provided there. It\u2019s clear the VA staff are doing all they can to care for and improve services to veterans in the Bronx and Westchester, even with all of the uncertainty. I will push back against any cuts by the Trump Administration that renege on our commitment to our veterans.",
