                "text": "I recently visited the Bronx VA Medical Center that provides care to many veterans in our district. It is unconscionable that this administration has proposed cutting 80,000 VA staff. VA staff make sure veterans receive the healthcare and benefits they have earned, and many are also veterans themselves. \n\nThis doesn't send the message of \"thank you for your service.\" It's a slap in the face.",
