                "text": "The Trump Administration\u2019s plan to revoke the EPA\u2019s 2009 finding that greenhouse gases pose a threat to public health, flies in the face of science and our fight against climate change. Alongside other decisions made by this administration, this rollback has the most lasting repercussions in the fight for our children\u2019s futures and environment.",
